# Document & academic skill routing

## Required behavior

- For tasks in the routing table below, **read** the matching `SKILL.md` under `~/.agents/skills/{name}/` (or `~/.cursor/skills/{name}/`) **before** executing.
- Do not invent steps, templates, or APIs without reading that skill file.
- Pick **one** primary skill per request; chain a second only when needed (e.g. paper + figure).

## Top-level skills

| User intent (examples) | Skill directory | Notes |
|------------------------|-----------------|-------|
| Papers, polish, review, Nature, citations, journal-club PPT | `nature-skills` | Monorepo; see sub-skills below |
| Patent, disclosure, prior art | `patent-disclosure-skill` | |
| Software copyright (软著) | `SoftwareCopyright-Skill` | |
| NSFC / grant applications | `nsfc-agent-skills` | |
| New slides / visual deck from scratch | `gpt-image2-ppt-skills` | |
| Image/PDF slides → editable PPTX | `image-to-editable-ppt-skill` | |
| Standardized technical / design system docs | `designdoc` | |
| General dev workflow (TDD, debug, brainstorm) | `superpowers` | Not document skills |

## nature-skills sub-skills

Read `~/.agents/skills/nature-skills/skills/nature-*/SKILL.md` (paths vary by monorepo layout).

| Sub-skill | Use |
|-----------|-----|
| `nature-writing` | Draft sections |
| `nature-polishing` | Polish prose |
| `nature-reviewer` | Pre-submission review |
| `nature-citation` | Citations |
| `nature-data` | Data availability |
| `nature-response` | Rebuttal letters |
| `nature-figure` | Publication figures |
| `nature-reader` | Full-paper reading / translation |
| `nature-paper2ppt` | Paper → Chinese meeting PPT |
| `nature-academic-search` | Literature search (MCP `academic-search`) |

## Disambiguation

| Scenario | Use |
|----------|-----|
| Chinese journal-club PPT from a paper | `nature-paper2ppt` |
| Magazine-style / generated visual PPT | `gpt-image2-ppt-skills` |
| Editable PPT from slide images | `image-to-editable-ppt-skill` |
| Patent vs 软著 | `patent-disclosure-skill` vs `SoftwareCopyright-Skill` |

Installed via `skill.yaml` in claude-in-cursor; sync with `node update.js --skills-only`.
